=v0.7.62.9 (2026-01-22)=

* Version bump from 0.7.62.8 to 0.7.62.9
* Add hash blacklist checking to dispatcher: queries with hashes matching entries in anon_hash_blacklist file are now rejected with rate-limit error
* Add decode_hex utility function to dispatcher_stub.cc for parsing blacklist hex values
* Refactor decode_hex in user_interface.cc: move to anonymous namespace for internal use only
* Code cleanup: fix indentation (tabs to spaces) in area_level dispatcher code

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.8 (2025-08-13)=

* Version bump to 0.7.62.8
* Enhanced resource planner rate limiting and timeout management in dispatcher
  * Added socket ratio parameter to probe() method for adaptive timeout tuning
  * Introduced dynamic timeout_pending calculation based on socket availability
  * Improved request queue enforcement for rate-limited clients considering socket pressure
  * Added get_open_socket_limit() accessor to Socket class

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.7 (2025-06-08)=

* Version bump to 0.7.62.7
* Updated source hash identifier in build configuration
* Fixed error handling in web_query to ensure proper return on HTTP 403 authorization failure

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.6 (2025-06-08)=

* Version bumped to 0.7.62.6
* Added origin blacklist filtering: server now reads from <code>origin_blacklist</code> file and rejects requests from blacklisted origins with 403 status
* Refactored CGI input handling: introduced <code>Input_From_CGI</code> struct to encapsulate HTTP method, headers, origin, and CGI parameters, simplifying parameter passing in <code>get_xml_cgi()</code>
* Code cleanup: removed trailing whitespace across template database backend files

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.5 (2025-02-14)=
* Version bump to 0.7.62.5
* Truncate long query strings in client logger to prevent excessively large log entries; queries exceeding 8192 bytes are logged with first and last 4096 bytes preserved

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.4 (2024-11-21)=

* Fixed floating-point precision issues in bounding box containment and intersection checks
* Added epsilon-based tolerance (5e-8) to latitude and longitude comparisons to handle floating-point rounding errors
* Improved intersection calculation for line segments crossing bbox boundaries, with additional boundary condition checks and assertions
* Corrected grammar in geometry module comments
* Updated version string and build metadata

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.3 (2024-11-20)=

* Version bump to 0.7.62.3
* Add <code>--limit-client-zero</code> dispatcher option to exempt localhost requests from resource control
* Implement <code>exempt_client_zero</code> flag in Global_Resource_Planner for conditional resource limit enforcement
* Update Global_Resource_Planner constructor and probe logic to respect localhost exemption setting
* Fix dispatcher_client error handling to properly classify zero acknowledgment codes as query rejections
* Remove trailing whitespace from dispatcher code

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.2 (2024-04-06)=

* Version bump to 0.7.62.2
* Remove unused Health_Checker class from resource_manager.h
* Fix Unix socket handling for macOS: adjust sun_len calculation (experimental)
* Suppress chmod error in Unix socket initialization

Summarized by Claude Haiku.

=v0.7.62.1 (2024-03-22)=

* Version bump to 0.7.62.1
